\par\par \b \uc2 ECB Nowotny:Euro Carries Burden Of US-China  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Moves-Paper\b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Oktober 2010\par 10:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 VIENNA (Dow Jones)--The euro is the loser of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves between the U.S. and China, with appreciations against the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  hampering exports from the euro zone, European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governing council member Ewald Nowotny said in an interview published Monday.\par \par \uc2 "It is clear the euro carries the main burden of the devaluations of the U.S. dollar and the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Nowotny told Austrian financial daily Wirtschaftsblatt.\par \par \uc2 "It's remarkable how fast the fluctuations occur, but the ECB has no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange target and therefore also no intention of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devaluations include attempts by Asian nations, especially \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to protect their exports against a weakening dollar by propping up the dollar and allowing a minimum of appreciation of their own \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Nowotny added that he sees positive and negative consequences alike from the current appreciation of the euro again the dollar and the yuan.\par \par \uc2 Euro-zone "exports are hampered by this, and at the same time, imports become cheaper, not least energy imports. It's not easy to draw a clear bottom line," Nowotny.\par \par \uc2 One country that could be hurt by what some have termed a "\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war" is Ireland, Nowotny said, because the shaky Irish economy depends strongly on U.S. investments.\par \par \uc2 "The decisive factor will be the length of this \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  adjustment phase. In the short term, the consequences will be marginal. In the long term, it could lead to the displacement of investments," he said.\par \par \uc2 Newspaper website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.wirtschaftsblatt.at"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.wirtschaftsblatt.at}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Flemming E. Hansen, Dow Jones Newswires; +43 1 513 69 22 10; flemming.hansen@dowjones.com [ 18-10-10 0806GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101018e6ai000lh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
